      "side": 1,
      "message": "This only tries to lift the root nodes in the shader node tree, excluding the clip shader node if it exists. This means that even a \"top-level\" transform that\u0027s e.g. under a blend node, will not be lifted, since the blend node is the root. That seems like an obvious thing to address, maybe even in this CL.",
